The complete provenance chain is:
PROJECT
 ↓
MODEL VERSION
 ↓
REVISION
 ↓
CODE MANIFEST
 ↓
VALIDATION RUN
 ↓
DOCUMENTATION GENERATION RUN
 ↓
VIEWS
 ↓
